{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":0.9,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":100,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"y":-423.2000000000001,"img":"chara019_1","addImg":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":100,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"y":-423.2000000000001,"img":"chara019_1","addImg":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]你问我平时都在做些什么？嗯……其实从大书院出来之后，人家也不是总在冒险的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]很多时候我都会接一些更像是打工的契约，[r]比如帮别人修房子，或者给人熏肉熏鱼什么的……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]哈哈……因为软软真的很厉害嘛，力气又大又能操纵火焰！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]总觉得我完全是在被软软养活一样，甚至有时候我都在想，软软能不能自己去工作呢？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]但是继续往下想的话，感觉人就会彻底变成废人了！[r][l]所以这是完全不能碰的话题！嗯……虽然有时候还是忍不住会有这种幻想啦……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"奇瓦-打工生涯","script":"yd_019_08-备份"}